function studioNav(){const primary=[['overview','Current workflow','1'],['builder','Build','2'],['test','Test & publish','3'],['runs','Run','4']],secondary=[['workspace','Navigation & access'],['forms','Forms'],['history','Version history']];const settingsSelected=secondary.some(([key])=>studioView===key);return `<nav class="studio-subnav" aria-label="Workflow Studio sections"><div class="studio-stage-nav">${primary.map(([k,v,n])=>`<button class="${studioView===k?'selected':''}" data-studio-go="${k}"><span>${n}</span>${v}</button>`).join('')}</div><details class="studio-settings-menu" ${settingsSelected?'open':''}><summary class="${settingsSelected?'selected':''}">Configure</summary><div>${secondary.map(([k,v])=>`<button class="${studioView===k?'selected':''}" data-studio-go="${k}">${v}</button>`).join('')}</div></details></nav>`}
function studioPicker(){const baseline=!studioDraft.id&&!studioDirty&&!studioDefinitions.length;return `<div class="studio-picker"><label>Current workflow<select data-studio-select>${studioDefinitions.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}" ${x.id===studioSelected?'selected':''}>${esc(x.name)} · ${esc(human(x.status))}</option>`).join('')}${!studioDraft.id?`<option value="" selected>${baseline?'Built-in default · Inquiry through follow-up':'Unsaved workflow'}</option>`:''}</select></label><details class="studio-create-menu"><summary>Create a different workflow</summary><div><button data-studio-complete-template>Complete patient journey</button><button data-studio-template>Inquiry to booking only</button><button data-studio-booked-template>Booked visit &amp; follow-up only</button><button data-studio-specialty-template>Specialty visit &amp; follow-up</button><button data-studio-new>Start blank</button></div></details></div>`}
function studioCoverageMap(){return `<section class="studio-coverage-map"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONFIGURATION COVERAGE</p><h3>What you can build here</h3><p>Configure the workspace and patient workflows, with native EHR actions and required review.</p></div></div><div class="studio-coverage-grid"><article><h4>Workspace, navigation and roles</h4><p>Set navigation labels, groups, order and visibility. Choose chart areas and manage named role policies.</p><button data-studio-go="workspace">Configure workspace</button></article><article><h4>Encounter sequence</h4><p>Connect steps, set responsible teams, timing, conditions and approvals. Signed records keep their native protections.</p><button data-studio-go="builder">Design nodes</button></article><article><h4>Forms</h4><p>Define patient intake fields and reviewed chart destinations. Clinical nodes use their native record forms.</p><button data-studio-go="forms">Edit forms</button></article><article><h4>Billing and licensed codes</h4><p>Coordinate coding, payment and claim review as staff tasks. Charge entry, licensed CPT/HCPCS lookup, posting and transmission remain native billing actions.</p><button data-studio-go="builder">Design billing review steps</button></article><article><h4>Sun AI nodes</h4><p>Choose one context field, a provider and an instruction. Identifier replacement, exact outbound preview, human approval, local restoration and output review are required.</p><button data-studio-design-sun>Design a Sun node</button></article><article><h4>Supported native actions</h4><p>Supported appointment and clinical events start published workflows automatically. Monitor checks current native records and reviewed dispatch results before completion.</p><button data-studio-go="runs">Monitor approvals</button></article></div><p class="studio-coverage-limit"><b>Outside this editor:</b> arbitrary code execution, new clinical data types, granting authority beyond existing roles, automatic claim submission and bypassing clinical or financial approvals. A team-task node coordinates work; it does not implement a new provider action.</p></section>`;}
function studioOverview(){
 const c=studioCounts(),baseline=!studioDefinitions.length&&!studioDirty,active=studioDraft.status==='active'&&!studioDirty,issues=studioValidation(),columns=studioColumns().filter(column=>!column.hidden),trigger=studioTriggers[studioDraft.trigger_type]||human(studioDraft.trigger_type),last=studioDraft.definition.steps.at(-1)?.title||'Workflow complete';
 const state=active?'Live workflow':baseline?'Built-in clinic workflow':'Draft workflow',badge=active?`Published · v${studioDraft.version||1}`:baseline?'Current baseline':`Draft · v${studioDraft.version||1}`;
 return `<main class="studio-overview">${studioPicker()}<div class="studio-overview-grid"><section class="studio-summary-card"><div class="studio-workflow-state"><span><i class="status-dot ${active?'live':baseline?'baseline':'draft'}"></i><span><b>${state}</b><small>${active?'Listening for matching events.':baseline?'The EHR works now; customize this path only when the clinic needs different automation.':'Not affecting patients or staff'}</small></span></span><span><b>${c.runs}</b><small>open</small></span><span><b>${c.blocked}</b><small>blocked</small></span></div><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT PATIENT JOURNEY</p><h3>${esc(studioDraft.name)}</h3><p>${studioDraft.definition.steps.length} connected steps from first contact through follow-up</p></div><span class="status-badge">${badge}</span></div><div class="studio-contract-strip"><span><small>STARTS WHEN</small><b>${esc(trigger)}</b></span><span>→</span><span><small>FINISHES WITH</small><b>${esc(last)}</b></span></div><div class="studio-path-preview">${columns.map((column,index)=>{const count=studioDraft.definition.steps.filter(step=>studioPhase(step)===column.key).length;return `<button data-studio-go="builder"><span>${index+1}</span><b>${esc(column.title)}</b><small>${count} step${count===1?'':'s'}</small></button>`}).join('')}</div><div class="studio-summary-actions"><button class="primary" data-studio-go="builder">${baseline?'Customize current workflow':'Open visual editor'}</button>${baseline?'':`<button data-studio-go="test">${active?'Test changes':'Test & publish'}</button>`}<button data-studio-go="runs">View live work</button></div></section><section class="studio-next-card"><p class="eyebrow">${active?'LIVE STATUS':baseline?'CURRENT SETUP':'NEXT ACTION'}</p><h3>${active?'What needs attention':baseline?'Ready for clinic work':'Finish this draft'}</h3>${active?`${c.blocked?`<button data-studio-go="runs"><span>!</span><span><b>${c.blocked} blocked run${c.blocked===1?'':'s'}</b><small>Open live work and resolve the blocking step.</small></span><span>→</span></button>`:'<div class="studio-clear-state"><b>No blocked work</b><small>The workflow is listening for matching events.</small></div>'}<button data-studio-go="runs"><span>→</span><span><b>Review live work</b><small>${c.runs} open patient journey${c.runs===1?'':'s'}.</small></span><span>→</span></button>`:baseline?`<div class="studio-clear-state"><b>No setup decision required</b><small>This complete built-in path is the clinic's starting point. Customize it to add conditions, integrations or a different sequence.</small></div><button data-studio-go="builder"><span>→</span><span><b>See how every step works</b><small>Open the visual map with inputs, actions, destinations and results.</small></span><span>→</span></button>`:`<div class="studio-readiness"><b>${issues.length?`${issues.length} item${issues.length===1?'':'s'} to fix`:'Ready to test'}</b><small>${issues[0]||'Run the safety check, then publish when you are ready.'}</small></div><button data-studio-go="builder"><span>1</span><span><b>Edit the visual path</b><small>Add, connect and configure the work.</small></span><span>→</span></button><button data-studio-go="test"><span>2</span><span><b>Test and publish</b><small>Check the journey without starting live work.</small></span><span>→</span></button>`}</section></div></main>`;
}
function studioConditionLabel(condition){if(!condition)return '';const field=condition.field.replace(/^\//,'').replaceAll('/',' › ')||'field',operator=human(condition.operator),value=['present','absent'].includes(condition.operator)?'':` ${typeof condition.value==='string'?condition.value:JSON.stringify(condition.value)}`;return `If ${field} ${operator}${value}`.slice(0,72)}
function studioNode(s,i){const flags=[s.manual_approval?{kind:'approval',label:'Approval'}:null,s.condition?{kind:'condition',label:studioConditionLabel(s.condition)}:null,(s.depends_on||[]).length?{kind:'dependency',label:`${s.depends_on.length} incoming`}:null].filter(Boolean);const state=String(s.state||s.status||'draft').toLowerCase();return `<button draggable="true" class="studio-node ${s.key===studioDraft._selectedStep?'selected':''} state-${esc(state)}" data-studio-node="${esc(s.key)}" data-runtime-state="${esc(state)}"><span class="studio-node-number">${i+1}</span><span><strong>${esc(s.title)}</strong><small>${esc(studioKinds[s.kind]||human(s.kind))}${s.assigned_role?` · ${esc(human(s.assigned_role))}`:''}</small>${flags.length?`<span class="studio-node-flags">${flags.map(flag=>`<em class="${flag.kind}">${esc(flag.label)}</em>`).join('')}</span>`:''}</span><span>⋮⋮</span></button>`}
function studioColumnManager(){const columns=studioColumns(),hiddenNodes=columns.filter(column=>column.hidden).reduce((sum,column)=>sum+studioDraft.definition.steps.filter(step=>studioPhase(step)===column.key).length,0);if(!studioCanManage())return hiddenNodes?`<div class="studio-hidden-warning"><b>${hiddenNodes} node${hiddenNodes===1?' is':'s are'} in hidden columns</b><span>Ask a workflow manager to show those columns before reviewing the complete path.</span></div>`:'';return `<section class="studio-column-manager"><div><b>Workflow columns</b><small>Add, rename, reorder or hide lanes without changing the node logic.</small>${hiddenNodes?`<span class="studio-hidden-warning"><b>${hiddenNodes} hidden node${hiddenNodes===1?'':'s'}</b> · Hidden nodes still run and are not shown on this canvas.</span>`:''}</div><div class="studio-column-list">${columns.map((column,index)=>{const count=studioDraft.definition.steps.filter(step=>studioPhase(step)===column.key).length;return `<span class="studio-column-chip ${column.hidden?'hidden':''}"><input aria-label="Column name" data-studio-column-title="${esc(column.key)}" value="${esc(column.title)}" maxlength="120">${column.hidden?`<strong class="studio-hidden-count">${count} hidden</strong>`:''}<button type="button" data-studio-column-move="${esc(column.key)}" data-direction="-1" ${index===0?'disabled':''} aria-label="Move ${esc(column.title)} left">←</button><button type="button" data-studio-column-move="${esc(column.key)}" data-direction="1" ${index===columns.length-1?'disabled':''} aria-label="Move ${esc(column.title)} right">→</button><button type="button" data-studio-column-toggle="${esc(column.key)}">${column.hidden?'Show':'Hide'}</button><button type="button" data-studio-column-delete="${esc(column.key)}" ${count?'disabled title="Move its nodes before deleting"':''}>Delete</button></span>`}).join('')}<button type="button" class="studio-add-column" data-studio-add-column>+ Add column</button></div></section>`}
function studioGraphEdges(visible,positions,width,height){const paths=[];for(const target of studioDraft.definition.steps){const to=positions.get(target.key);if(!to)continue;for(const sourceKey of target.depends_on||[]){const from=positions.get(sourceKey);if(!from)continue;const edgeId=`${sourceKey}--${target.key}`,mid=(from.x+to.x)/2;paths.push(`<path data-edge-id="${esc(edgeId)}" class="studio-graph-edge ${target.condition?'conditional':''}" d="M ${from.x} ${from.y} C ${mid} ${from.y}, ${mid} ${to.y}, ${to.x} ${to.y}" marker-end="url(#studio-arrow)"><title>${esc(sourceKey)} to ${esc(target.key)}${target.condition?' when condition matches':''}</title></path>`)}}return `<svg class="studio-graph-edges" viewBox="0 0 ${width} ${height}" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-label="Workflow connections"><defs><marker id="studio-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"/></marker></defs>${paths.join('')}</svg>`}
function studioCanvas(){const steps=studioDraft.definition.steps,visible=studioColumns().filter(column=>!column.hidden),selected=studioStep(),width=Math.max(1,visible.length)*240,rows=Math.max(1,...visible.map(column=>steps.filter(step=>studioPhase(step)===column.key).length)),height=128+rows*94,positions=new Map();visible.forEach((column,columnIndex)=>steps.filter(step=>studioPhase(step)===column.key).forEach((step,rowIndex)=>positions.set(step.key,{x:columnIndex*240+120,y:144+rowIndex*94})));if(!visible.length)return `${studioColumnManager()}<section class="studio-onboarding compact"><h3>No visible workflow columns</h3><p>Show or add a column before arranging nodes.</p></section>`;return `${studioColumnManager()}<div class="studio-graph-guide"><span>Scroll sideways to see every stage · Drag nodes to move them</span>${selected?`<a href="#studio-node-settings"><b>Selected: ${esc(selected.title)}</b> · Edit node settings ↓</a>`:'<span>Select a node to edit it</span>'}</div><div class="studio-graph-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="Workflow graph. Scroll horizontally to see all stages."><div class="studio-graph-board" style="--column-count:${visible.length};width:${width}px;min-height:${height}px">${studioGraphEdges(visible,positions,width,height)}<div class="studio-graph-columns">${visible.map(column=>`<section class="studio-phase" data-studio-drop-phase="${esc(column.key)}"><header><span>${steps.filter(step=>studioPhase(step)===column.key).length}</span><h3>${esc(column.title)}</h3><p>${esc(column.description||'Custom workflow lane')}</p></header><div class="studio-phase-nodes">${steps.map((step,index)=>studioPhase(step)===column.key?studioNode(step,index):'').join('')}</div><button class="studio-add-node" data-studio-add="${esc(column.key)}">+ Add node</button></section>`).join('')}</div></div></div>`}
function studioPalette(){return `<div class="studio-palette"><p class="eyebrow">ADD A MODULE</p><p class="muted">Choose what should happen next.</p>${Object.entries(studioKinds).map(([k,v])=>`<button data-studio-palette="${k}">${esc(v)}<span>+</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`}
const studioChartTargets={'demographics.preferred_name':'Preferred name','demographics.pronouns':'Pronouns','demographics.language':'Preferred language','demographics.administrative_gender':'Administrative gender','demographics.phone':'Phone','demographics.email':'Email'};
const studioMappedFieldTypes=new Set(['short_text','long_text','choice']);
const studioGenderChoices=['female','male','other','unknown'];
function studioFormMappingValidation(step){const used=new Set(),issues=[];for(const field of step.form_fields||[]){if(!field.chart_target)continue;if(!Object.hasOwn(studioChartTargets,field.chart_target)||!studioMappedFieldTypes.has(field.field_type))issues.push(`${step.title}: ${field.label} has an unsupported chart destination or answer type.`);if(used.has(field.chart_target))issues.push(`${step.title}: choose each chart destination only once.`);used.add(field.chart_target);if(field.chart_target==='demographics.administrative_gender'&&field.field_type==='choice'&&(field.options||[]).some(value=>!studioGenderChoices.includes(value)))issues.push(`${step.title}: administrative gender choices must use female, male, other or unknown.`);}return issues;}
function studioFieldMapping(step,field,index){if(step.kind!=='patient_form')return '';const compatible=studioMappedFieldTypes.has(field.field_type),used=new Set(step.form_fields.filter((value,position)=>position!==index).map(value=>value.chart_target));return `<div class="studio-field-options"><label for="studio-chart-target-${index}">Chart destination after staff review</label><select id="studio-chart-target-${index}" data-field-property="chart_target" ${compatible?'':'disabled'}><option value="">Review evidence only</option>${Object.entries(studioChartTargets).map(([target,label])=>`<option value="${target}" ${field.chart_target===target?'selected':''} ${used.has(target)?'disabled':''}>${esc(label)}${used.has(target)?' (used by another field)':''}</option>`).join('')}</select><small>${compatible?'Answers remain in the intake packet until staff reviews and explicitly applies selected chart changes.':'Choose text or choice answers to configure a chart destination.'}</small>${field.chart_target==='demographics.administrative_gender'?`<small>Supported values: female, male, other, unknown.</small>${field.field_type==='choice'?`<button type="button" data-studio-gender-options="${index}">Use supported gender choices</button>`:''}`:''}</div>`;}
function studioFields(s){return `<fieldset class="studio-form-builder"><legend>Form fields</legend>${s.form_fields.map((f,i)=>`<div class="studio-form-field" data-form-field="${i}"><label>Field label<input data-field-property="label" value="${esc(f.label)}" maxlength="120"></label><label>Answer type<select data-field-property="field_type">${['short_text','long_text','date','choice','checkbox','number'].map(t=>`<option value="${t}" ${t===f.field_type?'selected':''}>${esc(human(t))}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-field-property="required" ${f.required?'checked':''}> Required</label><button type="button" data-studio-remove-field="${i}" aria-label="Remove ${esc(f.label||'field '+(i+1))}">Remove</button>${f.field_type==='choice'?`<label class="studio-field-options">Choice options<input data-field-property="options" value="${esc((f.options||[]).join(', '))}" placeholder="Phone, Email, Text"><small>Separate options with commas.</small></label>`:''}${studioFieldMapping(s,f,i)}</div>`).join('')}<button type="button" data-studio-add-field>+ Add field</button></fieldset>`}

function studioConditionValueType(value){if(value===null)return 'null';if(Array.isArray(value)||typeof value==='object')return 'json';return typeof value}
function studioCastConditionValue(value,type){const raw=typeof value==='string'?value:JSON.stringify(value);if(type==='string')return raw??'';if(type==='boolean')return raw==='true';if(type==='number'){const number=Number(raw);return Number.isFinite(number)?number:0}if(type==='null')return null;if(type==='json'){try{return JSON.parse(raw)}catch{return {}}}return raw}
function studioConditionEditor(s){const condition=s.condition,valueType=condition?studioConditionValueType(condition.value):'string',value=condition&&(typeof condition.value==='string'?condition.value:JSON.stringify(condition.value));return `<fieldset class="studio-condition-editor"><legend>Run condition</legend><label class="review-ack"><input type="checkbox" data-studio-condition-enable ${condition?'checked':''}> Only run this node when a field matches</label>${condition?`<label>Context field path<input data-studio-condition-property="field" value="${esc(condition.field)}" placeholder="/appointment/type" pattern="/.*" maxlength="200"><small>Use a safe context path beginning with /.</small></label><label>Comparison<select data-studio-condition-property="operator">${['equals','not_equals','present','absent'].map(operator=>`<option value="${operator}" ${condition.operator===operator?'selected':''}>${esc(human(operator))}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>${['equals','not_equals'].includes(condition.operator)?`<div class="studio-condition-value"><label>Value type<select data-studio-condition-value-type>${['string','number','boolean','null','json'].map(type=>`<option value="${type}" ${valueType===type?'selected':''}>${esc(human(type))}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>${valueType!=='null'?`<label>Value<input data-studio-condition-property="value" data-value-type="${valueType}" value="${esc(value??'')}"></label>`:''}</div>`:'<p class="muted">This comparison only checks whether the field has a value.</p>'}<p class="studio-condition-summary">${esc(studioConditionLabel(condition))}</p>`:''}</fieldset>`}
let studioRunReadiness=null,studioRunReadinessError='',studioRunPatient=null,studioRunLoad=0,studioRunLoading=false,studioRunFilter='active';
function studioNativeInspector(step){
 if(typeof journeyNativeAllowed!=='function')return '';
 const allowed=journeyNativeAllowed(step.kind),resource=step.native?.resource||journeyDefaultBindings[step.kind],binding=journeyNativeResources[resource];
 if(!allowed.length)return `<section class="studio-native-binding"><h3>Native action</h3><p>${studioAiKinds.has(step.kind)?'Prepares a Sun draft through the reviewed provider flow.':studioIntegrationKinds.has(step.kind)?'A reviewed dispatch runs this action. Its provider result remains separate from the workflow step.':'This node records team work. It does not sign a clinical record, send a message or collect a payment.'}</p></section>`;
 return `<section class="studio-native-binding"><h3>Action & completion</h3><label>Completion source<select data-studio-native-resource>${!journeyDefaultBindings[step.kind]?`<option value="">${step.kind==='clinical_template'?'Choose the clinical record':'Staff-recorded work'}</option>`:''}${allowed.map(key=>`<option value="${esc(key)}" ${key===resource?'selected':''}>${esc(journeyNativeResources[key][0])}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>${binding?`<dl><div><dt>Opens</dt><dd>${esc(({schedule:'Linked appointment',clinical:'Patient chart',specialty:'Patient specialty care',previsit:'Intake readiness',billing:'Patient billing & coverage',claims:'Claims workspace',referrals:'Patient referrals',followup:'Follow-up work'})[binding[1]])}</dd></div><div><dt>Patient / encounter</dt><dd>From the run’s linked records</dd></div><div><dt>Completion</dt><dd>Current native evidence, then this node’s approval gate</dd></div></dl><p class="muted">Opening the screen or entering a note never marks this native work complete.</p>`:step.kind==='clinical_template'?'<p class="notice warning">Choose which clinical record this node requires before publishing.</p>':'<p class="muted">Completion records staff work only. Choose a native source when this step must verify a clinical or financial result.</p>'}</section>`;
}
function studioNativeValidation(step){if(typeof journeyNativeAllowed!=='function')return [];const allowed=journeyNativeAllowed(step.kind),resource=step.native?.resource;if(resource&&!allowed.includes(resource))return [`${step.title} has a completion source that does not match its action.`];if(step.kind==='clinical_template'&&!resource)return [`Choose the clinical completion source for ${step.title}.`];return [];}
async function studioSelectRun(id,refresh=false){
 const account=me,session=studioSessionGeneration,host=$('tools'),page=$('page-title')?.textContent,token=++studioRunLoad;studioSelectedRun=id;studioSelectedDispatch=null;clearStudioPrivacyReview();studioRunReadiness=null;studioRunReadinessError='';studioRunPatient=null;studioRunLoading=true;studioRender();
 const current=()=>account===me&&session===studioSessionGeneration&&token===studioRunLoad&&studioView==='runs'&&studioSelectedRun===id&&host===$('tools')&&page===$('page-title')?.textContent;
 try{
  let item=studioRuns.find(value=>value.id===id);if(refresh){const fresh=await api(`/api/v1/care-pathways/instances/${encodeURIComponent(id)}`);if(!current())return;if(fresh.id===id){item=fresh;studioRuns=studioRuns.map(value=>value.id===id?fresh:value);}}
  if(!item)throw new Error('This workflow run is no longer available.');
  const [readiness,patient]=await Promise.all([api(`/api/v1/care-pathways/instances/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/readiness`).catch(error=>({error:error.message})),item.patient_id?api(`/api/v1/patients/${encodeURIComponent(item.patient_id)}`).catch(()=>null):Promise.resolve(null)]);
  if(!current()||!!host?.querySelector?.('.pathway-action-form,.journey-booking-form,.journey-issue-form,.journey-issued-link')||!!host?.querySelector?.('.studio-native-preparation,.studio-dispatch-secret'))return;studioRunReadiness=readiness?.instance_id===id?readiness:null;studioRunReadinessError=readiness?.error||(!studioRunReadiness?'No native evidence was returned for this run.':'');studioRunPatient=patient;studioRunLoading=false;studioRender();
 }catch(error){if(current()){studioRunLoading=false;studioRunReadinessError=error.message;studioRender();}}
}

function studioInspectorAction(s){
 if(s.kind==='patient_form')return `<section class="studio-inspector-card studio-inspector-action"><div class="studio-inspector-card-head"><div><span>2</span><h3>Form setup</h3></div><small>${s.form_fields.length} ${s.form_fields.length===1?'field':'fields'}</small></div><p>Choose the questions, required answers and reviewed chart destinations for this patient form.</p><button class="primary studio-form-link" data-studio-go="forms">Edit form fields →</button></section>`;
 if(s.kind==='clinical_template')return `<section class="studio-inspector-card studio-inspector-action"><div class="studio-inspector-card-head"><div><span>2</span><h3>What does it do?</h3></div></div>${studioNativeInspector(s)}<p class="muted">Clinical fields are edited in the selected native record form.</p></section>`;
 return `<section class="studio-inspector-card studio-inspector-action"><div class="studio-inspector-card-head"><div><span>2</span><h3>What does it do?</h3></div></div>${studioNativeInspector(s)}${studioAiInspector(s)}</section>`;
}
function studioInspectorRules(s){const condition=s.condition?`Runs only when ${studioConditionLabel(s.condition).replace(/^If\s+/,'')}. If the rule is false, this step is skipped and downstream prerequisites treat it as resolved.`:'Runs whenever its prerequisites are complete.';return `<section class="studio-inspector-card"><div class="studio-inspector-card-head"><div><span>3</span><h3>When should it run?</h3></div><small class="${s.condition?'conditional':''}">${s.condition?'Conditional':'Always runs'}</small></div><p class="studio-rule-summary">${esc(condition)}</p><label>Due after start (hours)<input type="number" data-studio-property="due_hours" value="${s.due_after_minutes?Math.round(s.due_after_minutes/60):''}"></label><label class="review-ack"><input type="checkbox" data-studio-property="required" ${s.required?'checked':''}> Required step</label>${studioAiKinds.has(s.kind)?'<p class="muted"><b>Approval required:</b> before Sun runs and again before its draft is used.</p>':s.kind==='human_approval'?`<p class="muted"><b>Human approval required.</b> ${s.manual_approval?'This step must pass its approval gate.':'Save this draft to enable the approval gate for this older step.'}</p>`:`<label class="review-ack"><input type="checkbox" data-studio-property="manual_approval" ${s.manual_approval?'checked':''}> Require approval</label>`}${studioConditionEditor(s)}</section>`}
